# Space (live server): test-plan UI-05, the PDA's cargo and equipment windows (ui_pda_cargo.cpp, ui_pda_equip.cpp)
# and their transactions (inv_transaction.cpp, InvTransactionClass), with bug B-06 and the /resetship query of B-17.
# Elanor (_login_space) in Jupiter: O opens the cargo window (the Credits line, 6,032 in the store's rows), I the
# equipment window beside it. Her cargo (avatar_inventory_items, column by column, four rows: x 60 / 136 / 212, y
# 440 / 520 / 600 / 680): slot 4 Plasma Black Casters x1200 (6157), slot 5 the shield Gettysburg Beta (3743), slot 15
# empty; equipped: the shield Invincible Bastion (3793). Every move is INVENTORY_MOVE on the button-up
# (0x690D20), the server answering with the windows' contents.
# - equip / unequip: the cargo's shield dragged onto the Shields slot (480,790) swaps the two shields ('Gettysburg
#   Beta Installed'), the same drag again swaps them back.
# - B-06 (0x690D20): with another query of the view's query window open (the YES_NO of /resetship, sclient.cpp's
#   'This will reset all ship systems ...', B-17's string), the shield dropped into space (inventory 11: the dump)
#   ends the transaction (State 0, 0x690EE7) and nothing is sent; after No (800,578) the next swap goes out. Ours
#   before 2026-11-24 left State at 2, so that swap was refused (0x690AA0's busy test).
# - stack: the cargo moved one column right (236,740: slot 15 at 212,680), 600 of the 1200 casters dragged into slot
#   15 (a stack of more than one asks the number: the quantity bar of gd_selct.cpp, digits then Enter), then the 600
#   dragged back onto the stack (600 again); the column back (35,740).
#   e2e.py --live [--retail] --db-snapshot 7 --instance NAME run ui_cargo_equip
name: the PDA's cargo and equipment: equip, unequip, a dump during another query, split and stack (UI-05)
timeout: 400
include _login_space
key 0x4F
expect-event proxy '^input: replayed key 0x4F'
wait-quiet proxy 1.0 within 15
key 0x49
expect-event proxy '^input: replayed key 0x49'
wait-quiet proxy 1.0 within 15
move 1000,880
wait-quiet proxy 0.5 within 10
shot pda_open
# the Credits line (492 ink pixels on retail)
expect-ink pda_open 30,335,215,24 300
# equip: the cargo's shield onto the Shields slot (a swap), then back
down 136,520
wait-quiet proxy 0.3 within 5
up 480,790
expect-event antprox 'received INVENTORY_MOVE' within 10
wait-quiet proxy 1.5 within 20
move 1000,880
wait-quiet proxy 0.5 within 10
shot equipped
down 136,520
wait-quiet proxy 0.3 within 5
up 480,790
expect-event antprox 'received INVENTORY_MOVE' within 10
wait-quiet proxy 1.5 within 20
move 1000,880
wait-quiet proxy 0.5 within 10
shot equipped_back
# B-06: the dump while /resetship's query is open
key 0x0D
wait-quiet proxy 0.5 within 10
text '/resetship'
key 0x0D
wait-quiet proxy 1.0 within 15
shot resetship_query
down 136,520
wait-quiet proxy 0.3 within 5
up 1100,300
wait-quiet proxy 1.5 within 15
move 1000,880
wait-quiet proxy 0.5 within 10
shot dump_in_query
click 800,578
wait-quiet proxy 1.5 within 15
move 1000,880
wait-quiet proxy 0.5 within 10
shot query_no
# the transaction after the query: the swap goes out
down 136,520
wait-quiet proxy 0.3 within 5
up 480,790
expect-event antprox 'received INVENTORY_MOVE' within 10
wait-quiet proxy 1.5 within 20
down 136,520
wait-quiet proxy 0.3 within 5
up 480,790
expect-event antprox 'received INVENTORY_MOVE' within 10
wait-quiet proxy 1.5 within 20
move 1000,880
wait-quiet proxy 0.5 within 10
shot swapped_after_query
# split and stack
click 236,740
wait-quiet proxy 1.0 within 15
move 1000,880
wait-quiet proxy 0.5 within 10
shot cargo_right
down 60,440
wait-quiet proxy 0.3 within 5
up 212,680
wait-quiet proxy 1.0 within 10
text '600'
wait-quiet proxy 0.5 within 10
shot split_number
key 0x0D
expect-event antprox 'received INVENTORY_MOVE' within 10
wait-quiet proxy 1.5 within 20
move 1000,880
wait-quiet proxy 0.5 within 10
shot split
down 212,680
wait-quiet proxy 0.3 within 5
up 60,440
wait-quiet proxy 1.0 within 10
text '600'
key 0x0D
expect-event antprox 'received INVENTORY_MOVE' within 10
wait-quiet proxy 1.5 within 20
move 1000,880
wait-quiet proxy 0.5 within 10
shot stacked
click 35,740
wait-quiet proxy 1.0 within 15
key 0x49
wait-quiet proxy 1.0 within 15
move 1000,880
wait-quiet proxy 0.5 within 10
shot pda_closed
alive 1
